{"id":"xQ4vtGKEaro","title":"[Time] What time is it? - Easy Dialogue - Role Play","speaker":"English Singsing","channel":"Kids","level":"A1","duration":"04:22","views":"455K","emoji":"👶","color":"linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a, #fee140)","zh":"【English Singsing】[時間] 現在幾點了？ - 輕鬆對話 - 角色扮演（精選雙語跟讀教材）","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xQ4vtGKEaro","cues":[{"start":1.65,"duration":1.6,"text":"English sing-sing.","en":"English sing-sing.","zh":"英文唱唱。"},{"start":3.25,"duration":4.17,"text":"What time is it?","en":"What time is it?","zh":"現在是幾奌？"},{"start":7.42,"duration":9.81,"text":"What time is it, Dad?","en":"What time is it, Dad?","zh":"現在幾點了，爸爸？"},{"start":17.23,"duration":2.0,"text":"It's seven o'clock.","en":"It's seven o'clock.","zh":"已經七點了。"},{"start":19.23,"duration":2.0,"text":"Thank you.","en":"Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":21.23,"duration":4.18,"text":"What time is it?","en":"What time is it?","zh":"現在是幾奌？"},{"start":25.41,"duration":2.0,"text":"It's eight.","en":"It's eight.","zh":"八點了。"},{"start":28.21,"duration":2.0,"text":"Time for breakfast.","en":"Time for breakfast.","zh":"吃早餐的時間到了。"},{"start":30.21,"duration":2.0,"text":"Okay, coming.","en":"Okay, coming.","zh":"好的，來了。"},{"start":32.21,"duration":4.27,"text":"Are you ready?","en":"Are you ready?","zh":"你準備好了嗎？"},{"start":36.48,"duration":2.8,"text":"Yes, we're ready.","en":"Yes, we're ready.","zh":"是的，我們準備好了。"},{"start":39.28,"duration":2.6,"text":"Good. Let's go to school.","en":"Good. Let's go to school.","zh":"好的。我們去學校吧。"},{"start":42.88,"duration":3.73,"text":"Let's go home.","en":"Let's go home.","zh":"我們回家吧。"},{"start":46.61,"duration":2.8,"text":"Please, wait for me.","en":"Please, wait for me.","zh":"請等我。"},{"start":49.41,"duration":5.58,"text":"Okay.","en":"Okay.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":54.99,"duration":2.0,"text":"It's late. Time for bed.","en":"It's late. Time for bed.","zh":"現在已經太晚了。睡覺時間到了。"},{"start":56.99,"duration":2.8,"text":"Okay. Good night, Mom.","en":"Okay. Good night, Mom.","zh":"好的。晚安，媽媽。"},{"start":59.79,"duration":2.0,"text":"Good night, Dad.","en":"Good night, Dad.","zh":"晚安，爸爸。"},{"start":61.79,"duration":16.69,"text":"Good night.","en":"Good night.","zh":"晚安。"},{"start":78.48,"duration":2.0,"text":"What time is it, Dad?","en":"What time is it, Dad?","zh":"現在幾點了，爸爸？"},{"start":80.48,"duration":2.0,"text":"It's seven o'clock.","en":"It's seven o'clock.","zh":"已經七點了。"},{"start":82.48,"duration":4.24,"text":"Thank you.","en":"Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":86.72,"duration":2.0,"text":"What time is it?","en":"What time is it?","zh":"現在是幾奌？"},{"start":88.72,"duration":3.25,"text":"It's eight.","en":"It's eight.","zh":"八點了。"},{"start":91.97,"duration":2.0,"text":"Time for breakfast.","en":"Time for breakfast.","zh":"吃早餐的時間到了。"},{"start":93.97,"duration":4.27,"text":"Okay, coming.","en":"Okay, coming.","zh":"好的，來了。"},{"start":98.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Are you ready?","en":"Are you ready?","zh":"你準備好了嗎？"},{"start":100.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Yes, we're ready.","en":"Yes, we're ready.","zh":"是的，我們準備好了。"},{"start":102.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Good. Let's go to school.","en":"Good. Let's go to school.","zh":"好的。我們去學校吧。"},{"start":108.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Let's go home.","en":"Let's go home.","zh":"我們回家吧。"},{"start":110.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Please, wait for me.","en":"Please, wait for me.","zh":"請等我。"},{"start":112.24,"duration":2.0,"text":"Okay.","en":"Okay.","zh":"好的。"},{"start":114.24,"duration":5.55,"text":"It's late. Time for bed.","en":"It's late. Time for bed.","zh":"現在已經太晚了。睡覺時間到了。"},{"start":119.79,"duration":3.0,"text":"Okay. Good night, Mom.","en":"Okay. Good night, Mom.","zh":"好的。晚安，媽媽。"},{"start":122.79,"duration":2.0,"text":"Good night, Dad.","en":"Good night, Dad.","zh":"晚安，爸爸。"},{"start":124.79,"duration":2.0,"text":"Good night.","en":"Good night.","zh":"晚安。"}],"words":[]}